  ('794674247','walmart-2024-08-import-v1',array['R1','R2','R3','R4'],'Burt''s Bees Baby Organic Cotton Unisex Pajamas, Zip-Front/Non-slip Footed Sleeper, 2-Pack','Burt''s Bees Baby Organic Cotton Unisex Pajamas, Zip-Front/Non-slip Footed Sleeper, 2-Pack','Burt''s Bees Baby Organic Unisex Zip Front/Non-slip Footed PJs, 2-Pack, A-Bee-C & Stripes. Our footie pajamas are a cozy must-have for every little bee. Crafted from 100% organic cotton, these sleepers offer unparalleled softness and breathability. The convenient diagonal zip-front design makes diaper changes a breeze, and the zipper guard snap tab at the neck protects delicate skin. The sleeper PJs also feature elastic ankles to keep the footie in place and non-slip "bee grips" on the bottom for extra stability. This 2-pack includes charming A-Bee-C and classic stripe design, providing versatility and style. Give your baby the gift of comfort and quality with Burt''s Bees Baby sleepers! Slim and snug fit PJs are offered in sizes 12 to 24 months.','https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Burt-s-Bees-Baby-Organic-Cotton-Unisex-Pajamas-Zip-Front-Non-slip-Footed-Sleeper-2-Pack_5c8d6181-acd6-4e59-bcc7-c1a2d2886d46.a14556a049a41fc7cebd124eb705a6e2.jpeg','Gender Neutral Newborn Baby Clothing',22.91000000000000,30900,'fixed-1350-round-100','https://www.walmart.com/ip/Burt-s-Bees-Baby-Organic-Cotton-Unisex-Pajamas-Zip-Front-Non-slip-Footed-Sleeper-2-Pack/794674247',true),
