  ('14123516','walmart-2024-08-import-v1',array['R1','R2','R3','R4'],'Ragu Chunky Garden Pasta Sauce with Tomatoes, Onions, Celery, Carrots, Zucchini, Green Bell Peppers, 24 oz','Ragu Chunky Garden Pasta Sauce with Tomatoes, Onions, Celery, Carrots, Zucchini, Green Bell Peppers, 24 oz','One 24 oz jar of Ragu Chunky Garden Combination Pasta Sauce with Diced Tomatoes, Onions, Celery, Carrots, Zucchini, and Green Bell Peppers Pasta sauce that stays close to the roots - Made with chopped vegetables that you can see for a well-balanced texture and flavor, this red sauce is brimming with vine-ripened tomatoes, onions, celery, carrots, zucchini, and green bell peppers Quality ingredients, delicious taste - Red pasta sauce made from an authentic recipe with high quality ingredients to create a tomato sauce that is perfect for weeknight family dinners Make easy, Italian-inspired dinners - Ragu sauce brings flavor and quality so you can create delicious Italian family meals in minutes Versatile Italian flavor - Use this chunky garden tomato pasta sauce to create dishes like vegetable pasta primavera, veggie lasagna or add to cooked noodles as a traditional spaghetti sauce Endless recipes - Create mouthwatering meals you and your family with love like stuffed shells with ricotta cheese or pasta primavera Crafted with Passion since 1937 - Trusted for over 80 years to bring families together at the table, Ragu pasta sauces are ideal for family dinners','https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Ragu-Chunky-Garden-Pasta-Sauce-with-Tomatoes-Onions-Celery-Carrots-Zucchini-Green-Bell-Peppers-24-oz_553f1043-244f-433b-9e86-1ddd165dc991.63b208cb9e130f7a3503061122a7457d.jpeg','Pantry staples',2.240000000000000,3000,'fixed-1350-round-100','https://www.walmart.com/ip/Ragu-Chunky-Garden-Pasta-Sauce-with-Tomatoes-Onions-Celery-Carrots-Zucchini-Green-Bell-Peppers-24-oz/14123516',true),
