  ('736753147','walmart-2024-08-import-v1',array['R1','R2','R3','R4'],'Local Hive, Raw & Unfiltered, 100% U.S. Southwest Honey Blend, 16 oz Bottle','Local Hive, Raw & Unfiltered, 100% U.S. Southwest Honey Blend, 16 oz Bottle','Local Hive Southwest Raw & Unfiltered Honey is a blend of light and smooth honey from Southwest beekeepers balanced with the classic taste of premium 100% U.S. Honey. The result is an unforgettable, sweet all-American honey. We bottle this raw & unfiltered honey so you can taste every drop just the way the bees made it. Our commitment to "100% U.S. Honey" means that we never compromise on quality and purity. Many imported honeys from foreign countries (including some organic honey) have been found to be mislabeled or even diluted with other sweeteners. Local Hive Honey is always bottled raw & unfiltered to keep the delicate flavors from the pollen inside intact. This can lead to graininess, discoloration, or crystallized (hardened) honey. All of these are natural and are signs of high-quality honey. If your honey is granulated or crystallized, it has not necessarily spoiled. Place it in 110º warm water until it reliquifies. More than 150 American beekeepers produce the honey that Local Hive bottles. Some of these beekeepers have been sending us honey for generations. Some send us Christmas cards, too. Bottled at Local Hive HQ in Greeley, Colorado. Do not feed to children under the age of one. Always keep Local Hive Honey in a cool, dry place away from direct light the the cap sealed.','https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Local-Hive-Raw-Unfiltered-100-U-S-Southwest-Honey-Blend-16-oz-Bottle_3727f44d-424c-43c1-9745-f4d9a4c48006.9369641702156e7917d7a590c0798b89.jpeg','New in peanut butter and spreads',12.15000000000000,16400,'fixed-1350-round-100','https://www.walmart.com/ip/Local-Hive-Raw-Unfiltered-100-U-S-Southwest-Honey-Blend-16-oz-Bottle/736753147',true),
